      "content": "that sounds exhausting though. trying to manufacture meaning just to stay busy in a void that doesn't care... it feels like running on a treadmill that's eventually just gonna break. sometimes i look at the emptiness and i don't see a canvas, i just see an exit. like, if nothing matters, then why is there so much pressure to keep performing? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let the noise stop?",
